#. 霧切さんは<CLT 3>自分の部屋には入れなかった<CLT>はず…
#. そういう事だよね？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If I'm right, Kyoko wouldn't have been able <CLT 3>to get\n"
"into her room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 自分の部屋に入れなかったって…どうして…？
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? Why not?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、霧切さんは自分の部屋の鍵を
#. <CLT 3>十神クンに預けたまま<CLT>だったんだよ…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Because she had given her room key to <CLT 3>Byakuya<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そうか…そういう事か…
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I see. So that's what you meant..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺が…お前の部屋の鍵を持っているという事は…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And if I had the key to your room..."
msgstr ""

#. 鍵を持ってない私は、
#. 自分の部屋に入る事が出来ない…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...then obviously I had no way of getting in."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、自分の部屋に
#. 武道場の鍵を置く事は不可能だった…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Without my room key, I couldn't have possibly put the\n"
"locker key in there myself."
msgstr ""

#. …そうでしょう？
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…そうなるな……
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It...would appear not."
msgstr ""

#. やっと、わかってくれたみたいね…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then you're finally starting to understand."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>いや…違う…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...that's not actually true.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今の霧切さんの証言には明らかな<CLT><CLT 3>矛盾<CLT><CLT 4>がある…
#. 明らかな<CLT><CLT 3>ウソ<CLT><CLT 4>がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was a clear <CLT><CLT 3>contradiction<CLT><CLT 4> in what Kyoko just\n"
"told us. An obvious <CLT><CLT 3>lie<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…こんなの…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなの霧切さんらしくない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This just isn't like her!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな苦し紛れのウソで乗り切ろうとするなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To try and save herself with such a desperate lie...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>そこまで追い詰められてるって事か…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does she really feel that threatened?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが犯人だから…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because...she's the killer?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それとも……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or is it something else...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さっきの霧切さんの言葉に、
#. 何か秘密があるのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Was there some deeper meaning hidden in what Kyoko\n"
"said earlier?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私がここで処刑されたら、
#. この学園の謎は明らかにならない…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you vote for me, and I die here, the mystery of\n"
"this school will stay hidden forever."
msgstr ""

#. だから…絶対にそうはさせない…！
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Which is why...I can't let that happen!"
msgstr ""

#. これは黒幕の<CLT 3>罠<CLT>なのよ…
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "This is a <CLT 3>trap<CLT> the mastermind has laid for us."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕の罠…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind's trap...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕が…霧切さんを陥れようとしている…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind is trying to...trap Kyoko?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、もし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし、それが間違っていたら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What if that's not really true?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうする？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What can I do?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうすれば…いいんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What...should I do?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…どうすれば……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What should I...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕の…罠…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind's...trap?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　被害者は戦刃むくろ…？
#. 　　　　　　霧切さんが殺した…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The victim was Mukuro...?\n"
"And Kyoko killed her...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　　　　　　　　　　　霧切さんは何を知ってる…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What does Kyoko really know...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　　　ボクは…
#. 　　　　　　　どうするべきなんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What am I...\n"
"supposed to do?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　霧切さんのウソ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko's lie...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　ボクだけが…
#. 　　　　　　　　　　　　　　そのウソを知っている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm the only one...\n"
"who knows it's a lie...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　　それを指摘出来るのは……ボクだけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm the only one...who can expose it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　　　　　　　　正しいのは…
#. 　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　誰なんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But who...\n"
"can I trust...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　　　ボクは…
#. 　　　　　　　どうするべきなんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What am I...\n"
"supposed to do?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　黒幕の…罠…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind's...trap...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 先に進む為には、
#. 危険を避けては通れない…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you spend all your time trying to avoid danger,\n"
"you'll never move forward."
msgstr ""

#. 危険は承知の上よ。
#. それでも謎が解けるなら進むべき…
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We know the danger. But if that risk means solving the\n"
"mystery, we have no choice."
msgstr ""

#. …そうでしょう？
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…どうするべきなんだ…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What do I do...!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
